{"id":"04c0cf141af8331a","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-lindelof.md","title":"Lindelöf Hypothesis","display":"df-lindelof — Lindelöf Hypothesis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lindelof","aliases":["58-df-lindelof"],"display":"df-lindelof — Lindelöf Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lindelof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lindelof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lindelof — Lindelöf Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"baa56d22ed548761\" href=\"?note=baa56d22ed548761\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md\">../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid s\\neq1\\}\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(\\zeta:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid s\\neq1\\}\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span>（Riemann zeta 函数，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"baa56d22ed548761\" href=\"?note=baa56d22ed548761\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md\">../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon,C,T_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\varepsilon,C,T_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LH}\">\\(\\mathrm{LH}\\)</span>（本文件定义的 Lindelöf 假设）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lindelof} \\vdash \\mathrm{LH}\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists C,T_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(T_0\\leq|t|\\to|\\zeta(\\tfrac12+it)|\\leq C|t|^\\varepsilon\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lindelof} \\vdash \\mathrm{LH}\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists C,T_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(T_0\\leq|t|\\to|\\zeta(\\tfrac12+it)|\\leq C|t|^\\varepsilon\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lindelöf (1908): <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\">\\(\\zeta\\)</span> has order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(t^\\varepsilon)\">\\(O(t^\\varepsilon)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The Riemann hypothesis implies LH; the converse is not known.</li>\n<li>LH is equivalent to several sharp moment-growth bounds for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\">\\(\\zeta\\)</span> on the critical line, not to a statement that “almost all zeros lie near” that line.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md","status":"resolved","id":"baa56d22ed548761","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md","status":"resolved","id":"baa56d22ed548761","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\zeta:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid s\\neq1\\}\\to\\mathbb C$（Riemann zeta 函数，see [[../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\zeta:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid s\\neq1\\}\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon,C,T_0\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lindelof} \\vdash \\mathrm{LH}\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists C,T_0\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(T_0\\leq|t|\\to|\\zeta(\\tfrac12+it)|\\leq C|t|^\\varepsilon\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\zeta","display":false},{"tex":"O(t^\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta","display":false}],"bytes":1076,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-782","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-lindelof.md|58-df-lindelof]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["baa56d22ed548761"]}